                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-navy">1. Control Panels: cPanel '
                '&amp; Plesk</h2>\n'
                '  <p>Your control panel is the central nervous system of your hosting server. <a '
                'href="/cpanel-license" class="font-semibold text-brand hover:underline">cPanel &amp; WHM</a> remains '
