                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-navy">How Automated IP Licensing '
                'Actually Works</h2>\n'
                '  <p>Software vendors like cPanel, CloudLinux, and LiteSpeed do not use static serial numbers or '
                'license keys stored in files. Instead, when the server starts or runs its periodic cron tasks, it '
                'connects to a licensing verification server and asks: <em>"Is IP address 198.51.100.24 authorized to '
