                '  <p>The standout feature of LiteSpeed is its server-level caching engine. In the WHM plugin, open '
                'the <strong>LiteSpeed Web Cache Manager</strong>:</p>\n'
                '  <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">\n'
                '    <li>Click <strong>WordPress Cache</strong> and run a server-wide scan.</li>\n'
