                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-navy">Fine-Tuning Worker Processes '
                'and Memory Limits</h2>\n'
                '  <p>For maximum server stability during heavy traffic spikes, adjust the external application '
                'process limits in the LiteSpeed WebAdmin Console (port 7080):</p>\n'
                '  <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">\n'
                '    <li><strong>Max Connections:</strong> Increase from 500 to 2000 to handle high concurrency.</li>\n'
