                '  <p>For hosting companies focused on maximizing profit margins, DirectAdmin is the top financial '
                'choice. With flat-rate licensing and unlimited account quotas, resellers can sell hundreds of hosting '
                "packages without incurring escalating software license overages. DirectAdmin's native three-tier role "
                'switching allows instant toggling between reseller and end-user modes.</p>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-navy">Client Isolation and Security '
                'in Multi-Reseller Environments</h2>\n'
                '  <p>When multiple resellers share a single server, preventing cross-tenant interference is critical. '
                'Stacking your chosen control panel with <a href="/cloudlinux-license" class="font-semibold text-brand '
