                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-navy">The Ultimate Multi-Tenant '
                'Performance Stack</h2>\n'
                '  <p>To build a high-performance hosting platform, top hosting providers combine CloudLinux with '
