                "    <li><strong>Drastic Support Ticket Reductions:</strong> Prevents 90% of 'slow website' and "
                "'server down' support tickets caused by noisy neighbors.</li>\n"
                '    <li><strong>Premium Plan Monetization:</strong> Upsell high-resource clients to specialized '
                'packages with higher CPU and RAM allocations using LVE Manager.</li>\n'
                '  </ul>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-navy">CloudLinux License Pricing: '
