                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-navy">MySQL Governor: Preventing '
                'Relational Database Crashes</h2>\n'
                '  <p>Relational database contention is the most common cause of multi-tenant server outages. When an '
