                'through prerequisites, automated script execution, license activation, and post-installation '
                'tuning.</p>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-navy">cPanel VPS Installation '
