                'href="/cloudlinux-license" class="font-semibold text-brand hover:underline">CloudLinux OS license</a> '
                'enforces strict per-user CPU, RAM, and IOPS throttling via LVE Manager.</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>6. Missing PHP Opcode Caching (OPcache):</strong> Ensure Zend OPcache is enabled in '
