                '    <li><strong>7. Brute-Force Bot Traffic and XML-RPC Attacks:</strong> Thousands of bot attacks '
                'hammering <code class="rounded bg-mist px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.85em] text-navy">xmlrpc.php</code> or '
