                'text-navy">top</code> for high steal time (<code class="rounded bg-mist px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.85em] '
                'text-navy">%st</code>). If steal time exceeds 5-10%, request a host node migration.</li>\n'
                '  </ol>\n'
