                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-navy">Tier 3: OS Kernel and Resource '
                'Governance (Fixes 11 to 15)</h2>\n'
                '  <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">\n'
                '    <li><strong>11. Reduce Kernel Swappiness:</strong> Lower swappiness from default 60 to 10 (<code '
                'class="rounded bg-mist px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.85em] text-navy">sysctl vm.swappiness=10</code>) to '
