                '<p class="text-lg text-gray-600">Maximizing the performance, speed, and uptime of a Linux Virtual '
                'Private Server requires a holistic approach to optimization. Because virtualized instances operate '
                'with dedicated CPU and memory bounds, tuning the operating system kernel, web server, database '
