                '    <li><strong>10. Activate HTTP/3 and QUIC:</strong> Eliminate TCP head-of-line blocking by '
                'enabling QUIC transport on modern web servers.</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>11. Audit Slow MySQL Queries:</strong> Enable slow query logging and add missing '
                'indexes to high-traffic database tables.</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>12. Increase File Descriptor Limits:</strong> Raise <code class="rounded bg-mist '
                'px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.85em] text-navy">nofile</code> limits in <code class="rounded bg-mist px-1.5 '
                'py-0.5 text-[0.85em] text-navy">/etc/security/limits.conf</code> to support high concurrent '
                'connections.</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>13. Tune max_connections in MySQL:</strong> Cap maximum database connections to '
                'prevent memory exhaustion under traffic surges.</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>14. Deploy NVMe Swap Space:</strong> Configure a 2 GB to 4 GB swap file on NVMe SSD '
