                'bg-mist px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.85em] text-navy">journalctl --vacuum-size=200M</code>.</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>19. Keep PHP Versions Up to Date:</strong> Run modern PHP versions (PHP 8.2 or 8.3) '
