                'Hole</strong>.</p>\n'
                '  <p>When packets exceed the maximum transmission unit (MTU) of an intermediate VPN or cloud tunnel '
                '(e.g. WireGuard or GRE), the router attempts to send an ICMP fragmentation needed packet. If a '
                'firewall blocks ICMP, the packet is silently dropped and SSH hangs:</p>\n'
                '  <pre class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl bg-navy p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-100"><code># '
                'Test lowering MTU temporarily on the VPS network interface (e.g. eth0)\n'
                'ip link set dev eth0 mtu 1420\n'
                '\n'
                '# Verify MTU settings\n'
                'ip link show eth0</code></pre>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-navy">5. Emergency Access via '
                'Virtualizor VNC Console</h2>\n'
                '  <p>If an aggressive firewall rule or network misconfiguration completely blocks SSH access, use the '
                'out-of-band VNC or serial console provided by your VPS virtualization control panel.</p>\n'
                '  <p>VPS providers running on a <a href="/virtualizor-license" class="font-semibold text-brand '
