                '  <p>The primary tool for refreshing your cPanel license is <code class="rounded bg-mist px-1.5 '
                'py-0.5 text-[0.85em] text-navy">cpkeyclt</code>. Execute this command as root via SSH:</p>\n'
                '  <pre class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl bg-navy p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-100"><code># '
