                '# If successful, the terminal will output:\n'
                '# Updating cPanel license...Done. Update succeeded.</code></pre>\n'
                '  <p>If you are using a <a href="/cpanel-license" class="font-semibold text-brand '
                'hover:underline">LicenBase cPanel license</a>, running our wrapper command <code class="rounded '
