                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-navy">3. Fix 2: Verifying Server '
                'Public IPv4 Address</h2>\n'
                '  <p>Cloud instances on AWS, Google Cloud, or behind NAT firewalls often have internal private IPs '
                '(e.g. <code class="rounded bg-mist px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[0.85em] text-navy">10.0.0.5</code>) while '
                'broadcasting through an Elastic or Floating public IP. Confirm your outbound public IP:</p>\n'
                '  <pre class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl bg-navy p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-100"><code># '
