                'alt="Side-by-side comparison of cPanel software license versus cPanel web hosting plan" width="960" '
                'height="420" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="w-full rounded-2xl border border-gray-200" '
                '/><figcaption class="mt-2 text-center text-xs text-gray-500">cPanel license vs cPanel hosting: '
