                'downtime.</p>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-navy">7. Expanding Your Server '
                'Software Stack</h2>\n'
                '  <p>Now that your cPanel VPS is active, enhance your server capabilities with complementary '
