                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight">Best Practices for Maximizing '
                'Your LiteSpeed ROI</h2>\n'
                '  <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Deploying LiteSpeed Enterprise delivers immediate '
                'performance gains, but taking full advantage of your license requires several configuration '
                'adjustments:</p>\n'
                '  <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">\n'
