                '  </ul>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight">How LicenBase Eliminates Tier '
                'Sizing Anxiety</h2>\n'
                '  <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Traditional vendors penalize businesses that upgrade '
