                'href="/deals" class="text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700 underline font-medium">bundled discount '
                'packages</a> covering control panels, web servers, and operating system licensing.</p>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight">How to Calculate Your Exact '
                'Server Workload Requirements</h2>\n'
                '  <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Many server administrators overspend on web server '
                "licenses because they mistakenly assume that licensing must match their server's total CPU core "
