                'tiers.</p>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight">Checklist: When to Upgrade '
                'Your LiteSpeed Worker Processes</h2>\n'
                '  <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Keep this practical upgrade checklist handy as your server '
                'traffic grows:</p>\n'
                '  <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">\n'
                '    <li><strong>SSL Handshake Saturation:</strong> If your server handles thousands of new HTTPS TLS '
                '1.3 connections per minute, moving from 1 worker to 2 or 4 workers eliminates TLS negotiation '
                'latency.</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>Heavy Non-Cached Dynamic Traffic:</strong> If you host large membership communities '
                'or interactive web applications where full-page caching is bypassed, multi-worker licensing allows '
                'parallel request dispatching.</li>\n'
