                'Cloudflare (1.1.1.1).</p>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight">Handling NAT and Multi-IP VPS '
                'Environments</h2>\n'
                '  <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">In complex server configurations featuring multiple '
                'secondary IP addresses or private internal subnets, LiteSpeed may inadvertently attempt outbound '
                "license verification using an unwhitelisted secondary IP. To resolve this, configure your server's "
