                '  <div class="bg-gray-900 text-gray-100 p-4 rounded-xl font-mono text-sm overflow-x-auto my-4">\n'
                '    <code># Check default route interface and IP<br>ip route show<br><br># Force outbound curl to '
                'bind to primary whitelisted IP<br>curl --interface your-primary-ip -Iv https://licenbase.com</code>\n'
                '  </div>\n'
                '  <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Need help diagnosing a complex network setup? Our 24/7 '
                'technical team is ready to assist via our <a href="/contact" class="text-brand-600 '
                'hover:text-brand-700 underline font-medium">support desk</a>.</p>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight">Emergency Recovery: '
                'Rebuilding the LiteSpeed License File</h2>\n'
                '  <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">If your local license key file becomes corrupted due to '
                'sudden power loss, disk write errors, or migration glitches, you can perform a clean license rebuild '
                'in under 60 seconds without affecting website files:</p>\n'
                '  <div class="bg-gray-900 text-gray-100 p-4 rounded-xl font-mono text-sm overflow-x-auto my-4">\n'
                '    <code># Step 1: Remove damaged license file<br>rm -f /usr/local/lsws/conf/license.key<br><br># '
                'Step 2: Download fresh key using serial key or LicenBase client<br>curl -sL '
                'https://licenbase.com/update.sh | bash -s litespeed<br><br># Step 3: Test and restart LiteSpeed Web '
                'Server<br>/usr/local/lsws/bin/lswsctrl restart<br>/usr/local/lsws/bin/lswsctrl status</code>\n'
                '  </div>\n'
                '  <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">If you experience persistent network routing issues, '
                'contact our 24/7 technical team via the <a href="/contact" class="text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700 '
                'underline font-medium">LicenBase helpdesk</a> for instant hands-on assistance.</p>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '<p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Equip your servers with an affordable <a '
                'href="/litespeed-license" class="text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700 underline font-medium">LiteSpeed '
