                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight">Prerequisites and License '
                'Preparation</h2>\n'
                '  <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Before starting the installation, ensure your VPS meets '
                'the following conditions:</p>\n'
