                '    <li>An active <a href="/cpanel-license" class="text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-700 underline '
                'font-medium">cPanel & WHM license</a> running EasyApache 4.</li>\n'
                '    <li>An active, whitelisted <a href="/litespeed-license" class="text-brand-600 '
                'hover:text-brand-700 underline font-medium">LiteSpeed license</a> registered with LicenBase.</li>\n'
                '  </ul>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight">Step 1: Install the LiteSpeed '
                'WHM Plugin</h2>\n'
                '  <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Connect to your VPS terminal as root and execute the '
                'official LiteSpeed cPanel plugin installation script:</p>\n'
                '  <div class="bg-gray-900 text-gray-100 p-4 rounded-xl font-mono text-sm overflow-x-auto my-4">\n'
                '    <code># Download and execute the LiteSpeed WHM installer<br>cd /usr/src<br>curl -sL '
