                '  </div>\n'
                '  <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Once complete, log into WHM and navigate to '
                '<strong>Plugins &gt; LiteSpeed Web Server Plugin</strong>.</p>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight">Step 2: Install LiteSpeed Web '
