                'class="w-full rounded-2xl border border-gray-200" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />\n'
                '  <figcaption class="mt-2 text-center text-xs text-gray-500">2026 cPanel VPS license tier pricing '
                'compared with LicenBase wholesale rates.</figcaption>\n'
                '</figure>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-navy">Understanding the 2026 cPanel '
                'VPS License Tiers</h2>\n'
