                'four standard account-capacity tiers. Each tier restricts the total number of cPanel user accounts '
                'that can be created in WebHost Manager (WHM):</p>\n'
                '  <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-gray-200"><table class="w-full min-w-[34rem] '
                'text-sm"><thead><tr><th class="border-b border-gray-200 bg-mist px-4 py-3 text-left text-xs font-bold '
                'uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-600">Tier Name</th><th class="border-b border-gray-200 bg-mist '
                'px-4 py-3 text-left text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-600">Account Quota</th><th '
                'class="border-b border-gray-200 bg-mist px-4 py-3 text-left text-xs font-bold uppercase '
                'tracking-wider text-gray-600">Standard Direct Retail</th><th class="border-b border-gray-200 bg-mist '
                'px-4 py-3 text-left text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-600">LicenBase Wholesale IP '
                'Rate</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 px-4 py-3 font-semibold '
                'text-navy">cPanel Solo</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 px-4 py-3">1 Account</td><td '
                'class="border-b border-gray-100 px-4 py-3 text-rose-600 font-semibold">$17.49 / mo</td><td '
                'class="border-b border-gray-100 px-4 py-3 text-emerald-600 font-bold">$4.00 / mo</td></tr><tr><td '
                'class="border-b border-gray-100 px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-navy">cPanel Admin</td><td '
                'class="border-b border-gray-100 px-4 py-3">Up to 5 Accounts</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 '
                'px-4 py-3 text-rose-600 font-semibold">$27.99 / mo</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 px-4 py-3 '
                'text-emerald-600 font-bold">$4.00 / mo</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 px-4 py-3 '
                'font-semibold text-navy">cPanel Pro</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 px-4 py-3">Up to 30 '
                'Accounts</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 px-4 py-3 text-rose-600 font-semibold">$42.99 / '
                'mo</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 px-4 py-3 text-emerald-600 font-bold">$4.00 / '
                'mo</td></tr><tr><td class="border-b border-gray-100 px-4 py-3 font-semibold text-navy">cPanel Premier '
                '(VPS)</td><td class="border-b border-gray-100 px-4 py-3">100+ Accounts</td><td class="border-b '
                'border-gray-100 px-4 py-3 text-rose-600 font-semibold">$60.99+ / mo</td><td class="border-b '
                'border-gray-100 px-4 py-3 text-emerald-600 font-bold">$8.00 / mo</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n'
                '  <p>When you purchase hardware from modern cloud providers (such as Hetzner Cloud, OVHcloud, '
                'Contabo, Linode, or Vultr), paying retail catalog prices for your control panel license often doubles '
                'or triples your overall monthly hosting expenditure. Understanding how accounts are counted in <code '
