                '    <li><strong>Premier VPS Node:</strong> $60.99 × 12 = $731.88 per year</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>Total Annual Retail Software Cost:</strong> Over <strong>$1,583.64 per year</strong> '
                'solely for control panel software licenses.</li>\n'
                '  </ul>\n'
