                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">4. Multi-Tenant CPU Throttling with '
                'CloudLinux</h2>\n'
                '  <p class="text-gray-600">In shared hosting environments, a single abusive tenant can consume 100% '
