                'OS</a> ($7.00/mo) and an affordable wholesale <a href="/cpanel-license" class="text-blue-600 '
                'font-semibold hover:underline">cPanel license</a> ($4.00/mo) creates a virtually self-healing web '
                'hosting environment.</p>\n'
                '  <p class="text-gray-600">Upgrade your hosting stack with LicenBase\'s wholesale licensing and '
                'deploy high-performance <a href="/litespeed-license" class="text-blue-600 font-semibold '
                'hover:underline">LiteSpeed Web Server</a> to keep your servers lightning-fast, ultra-secure, and '
                'completely resilient against downtime.</p>\n'
                '</section>',
