                'strategies to minimize your software expenses without sacrificing customer experience.</p>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">Understanding the WHMCS 2026 Pricing '
                'Architecture</h2>\n'
