                'within your installation. An active client is defined as any customer record with at least one active '
                'hosting package, registered domain, addon service, or unpaid recurring invoice. Unlike older '
                'perpetual licensing arrangements, every modern WHMCS deployment requires an active monthly or annual '
                'subscription.</p>\n'
