                '  <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">\n'
                '    <li><strong>Starter Tier (Up to 250 Clients):</strong> Targeted at newly launched web hosts and '
                'solo web design studios looking to automate billing for a small customer roster.</li>\n'
