                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">Control Panel Ecosystem and Multi-Tenant '
                'Security</h2>\n'
                '  <p>For hosting businesses running a commercial <a href="/cpanel-license" class="text-blue-600 '
                'font-semibold hover:underline">cPanel license</a> or <a href="/plesk-license" class="text-blue-600 '
                'font-semibold hover:underline">Plesk license</a>, LiteSpeed Enterprise is the only viable choice. '
                'Through the official WHM LiteSpeed Web Server plugin, administrators can:</p>\n'
                '  <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">\n'
                '    <li>Switch between Apache and LiteSpeed in under two seconds with zero downtime.</li>\n'
                '    <li>Manage mass WordPress cache deployments across thousands of customer websites with '
                'centralized cache pre-warming.</li>\n'
                '    <li>Enforce resource limits dynamically per cPanel user via CloudLinux integration, preventing '
                'memory spikes from cascading across neighboring sites.</li>\n'
                '    <li>Activate automated reCAPTCHA shielding against HTTP flood and brute-force bot attacks '
                'directly at the web server layer.</li>\n'
                '  </ul>\n'
                '  <p>This integration ensures seamless compatibility with existing customer setups, backup routines, '
                'and SSL certificate management tools.</p>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">High-Concurrency PHP Execution: LSAPI vs. '
                'PHP-FPM</h2>\n'
                '  <p>Beyond static file serving, dynamic PHP performance is where the difference between web servers '
                'impacts real-world user experience and server load averages. LiteSpeed Enterprise utilizes '
                '<strong>LiteSpeed SAPI (LSAPI)</strong>, a dedicated, highly optimized server application programming '
                'interface engineered specifically for PHP.</p>\n'
                '  <p>Compared to traditional FastCGI or PHP-FPM architectures:</p>\n'
                '  <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">\n'
                '    <li><strong>Process Checkpointing:</strong> LSAPI maintains persistent worker pools that bypass '
                'heavy PHP environment re-initialization on subsequent HTTP requests, yielding up to 50% lower Time to '
                'First Byte (TTFB).</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>Smart Memory Recycling:</strong> LSAPI monitors process memory consumption and '
                'gracefully recycles bloated worker processes after completing batches of requests, preventing memory '
                'leaks during unexpected traffic surges.</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>Native CloudLinux CageFS Integration:</strong> LSAPI switches user credentials at the '
                'process level before executing PHP code, ensuring absolute security compartmentalization without '
                'spawning costly subshells.</li>\n'
                '  </ul>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">Step-by-Step: Upgrading from Apache to '
                'LiteSpeed on cPanel</h2>\n'
                '  <p>Switching an active cPanel server from Apache to LiteSpeed Enterprise requires zero downtime and '
                'can be executed via SSH terminal or the WHM plugin:</p>\n'
                '  <pre class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl bg-gray-900 p-4 text-sm text-gray-100 font-mono"><code># 1. '
                'Download and run the official LiteSpeed cPanel installer script\n'
                'cd /usr/src\n'
                'wget https://www.litespeedtech.com/packages/cpanel/lsws_whm_autoinstaller.sh\n'
                'chmod +x lsws_whm_autoinstaller.sh\n'
                './lsws_whm_autoinstaller.sh\n'
                '\n'
                '# 2. Switch port offset to replace Apache live (zero downtime)\n'
                '/usr/local/lsws/admin/misc/cp_switch_ws.sh lsws\n'
                '\n'
                '# 3. Verify LiteSpeed is listening on HTTP (80) and HTTPS (443)\n'
                '/usr/local/lsws/bin/lshttpd -v</code></pre>\n'
                '  <p>If you ever need to revert to Apache for legacy debugging, executing '
                '<code>/usr/local/lsws/admin/misc/cp_switch_ws.sh apache</code> instantly flips the active web server '
                'back to Apache without modifying site files.</p>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">Cost Breakdown: How to Get LiteSpeed '
                'Enterprise Affordably</h2>\n'
                '  <p>While OpenLiteSpeed is completely free, its lack of drop-in Apache compatibility and control '
                'panel plugins limits its utility primarily to bespoke single-application VPS instances managed '
                'through CyberPanel or manual CLI configs.</p>\n'
                '  <p>For agencies, SaaS platforms, and commercial web hosts, LiteSpeed Enterprise provides the '
                "reliability, automation, and speed necessary for production workloads. Through LicenBase, you don't "
                'have to pay steep retail prices. We provide legitimate, automated IP licensing for an authentic <a '
                'href="/litespeed-license" class="text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline">LiteSpeed license</a> '
