                '  <p>Take advantage of our <a href="/deals" class="text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline">combo '
                'discount deals</a> to bundle LiteSpeed with cPanel and CloudLinux, giving your servers maximum '
                'concurrency and lightning-fast TTFB at a fraction of standard hosting costs.</p>\n'
                '</section>\n',
