                'license is applied. While the Free tier gives a quick glimpse into the interface, its limitations '
                'quickly become an operational bottleneck for production hosting:</p>\n'
                '  <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-gray-200">\n'
                '    <table class="w-full text-left text-sm text-gray-600">\n'
                '      <thead class="bg-gray-50 text-xs font-bold uppercase text-gray-700">\n'
                '        <tr>\n'
                '          <th class="p-3">Feature Capability</th>\n'
                '          <th class="p-3">Softaculous Free</th>\n'
                '          <th class="p-3">Softaculous Premium</th>\n'
                '        </tr>\n'
                '      </thead>\n'
                '      <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-100">\n'
                '        <tr>\n'
                '          <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-gray-900">Total Available Scripts</td>\n'
                '          <td class="p-3">~50 Limited Scripts</td>\n'
                '          <td class="p-3">450+ Full Application Suite</td>\n'
                '        </tr>\n'
                '        <tr>\n'
                '          <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-gray-900">Automated Version Upgrades</td>\n'
                '          <td class="p-3">Manual Only</td>\n'
                '          <td class="p-3">Automated Background Patching</td>\n'
                '        </tr>\n'
                '        <tr>\n'
                '          <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-gray-900">WordPress Staging &amp; Cloning</td>\n'
                '          <td class="p-3">Disabled</td>\n'
                '          <td class="p-3">1-Click Clone, Push-to-Live &amp; Staging</td>\n'
                '        </tr>\n'
                '        <tr>\n'
                '          <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-gray-900">Remote Cloud Backups</td>\n'
