                'non-technical clients.</p>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">Why Softaculous Premium is Vital for Hosting '
                'Security</h2>\n'
                '  <p>Beyond convenience, Softaculous Premium plays a direct role in protecting your server fleet from '
                'cyber intrusions and malware infections. Outdated WordPress plugins and abandoned CMS installations '
                'are the primary entry points for web shell exploits and phishing uploads on shared servers.</p>\n'
                '  <p>Softaculous Premium fortifies your server environment through automated maintenance '
                'routines:</p>\n'
                '  <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">\n'
                '    <li><strong>Automated Core and Plugin Patching:</strong> Allows end users to opt into automated '
                'security updates for WordPress, ensuring vulnerabilities are patched within hours of public '
                'disclosure.</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>Automated Pre-Update Snapshots:</strong> Before updating a script, Softaculous '
