                'directly to offsite Google Drive or Amazon S3 buckets, saving local VPS storage.</li>\n'
                '  </ul>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">Empowering Clients with WordPress Staging '
                'and Cloning</h2>\n'
                '  <p>For freelance agencies and web development firms, the built-in WordPress Manager in Softaculous '
                'Premium provides enterprise-level workflow tools that rival expensive managed hosting platforms:</p>\n'
                '  <ol class="list-decimal space-y-2 pl-6">\n'
