                '    <li><strong>Safe Testing Environment:</strong> Test theme upgrades, PHP 8.x compatibility, and '
                'checkout gateway configurations without risking live customer transactions.</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>Push to Live:</strong> Once testing is validated, merge the staging changes back to '
                'the production environment seamlessly.</li>\n'
                '  </ol>\n'
                '  <p>Delivering these capabilities directly inside your <a href="/cpanel-license" '
                'class="text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline">cPanel license</a> dashboard elevates your '
                'hosting package from a generic server commodity into a high-value managed solution.</p>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">Server-Wide Administration: CLI Management '
                'and Script Whitelisting</h2>\n'
                '  <p>For hosting administrators managing large server fleets, Softaculous Premium includes an '
                'extensive command-line interface (CLI) located at '
                '<code>/usr/local/cpanel/whostmgr/docroot/cgi/softaculous/cli.php</code>. This enables root '
                'administrators to automate maintenance routines across all client accounts:</p>\n'
                '  <pre class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl bg-gray-900 p-4 text-sm text-gray-100 font-mono"><code># '
                'Update all installed scripts and definition packages\n'
                'php /usr/local/cpanel/whostmgr/docroot/cgi/softaculous/cli.php --upgrade\n'
                '\n'
                '# Automate mass WordPress core upgrades across all accounts\n'
