                'background daemons is memory taken away from your MySQL buffer pool, PHP-FPM workers, and web server '
                'caches:</p>\n'
                '  <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-gray-200">\n'
                '    <table class="w-full text-left text-sm text-gray-600">\n'
                '      <thead class="bg-gray-50 text-xs font-bold uppercase text-gray-700">\n'
                '        <tr>\n'
                '          <th class="p-3">Control Panel</th>\n'
                '          <th class="p-3">Base RAM Footprint (Idle)</th>\n'
                '          <th class="p-3">Recommended VPS RAM</th>\n'
                '          <th class="p-3">Licensing Model</th>\n'
                '        </tr>\n'
                '      </thead>\n'
                '      <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-100">\n'
                '        <tr>\n'
                '          <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-gray-900">HestiaCP</td>\n'
                '          <td class="p-3 text-emerald-600 font-semibold">~250 MB to 350 MB</td>\n'
                '          <td class="p-3">512 MB to 1 GB RAM</td>\n'
                '          <td class="p-3 text-emerald-600 font-semibold">100% Free (GPL v3)</td>\n'
