                '    </table>\n'
                '  </div>\n'
                '  <figure class="my-6 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 bg-gray-900/5 p-2">\n'
                '  <img src="/assets/img/blog/cpanel-vs-hestiacp-vs-directadmin-best-panel-small-vps-1.svg" '
                'alt="cPanel vs DirectAdmin vs HestiaCP small VPS resource comparison" width="800" height="420" '
                'class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg shadow-sm" loading="lazy">\n'
                '  <figcaption class="text-xs text-gray-500 text-center mt-2 px-2">Comparison of RAM footprints, CPU '
                'overhead, web server architectures, and licensing costs.</figcaption>\n'
                '</figure>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">1. HestiaCP: The Champion for 1 GB RAM '
                'Budget Nodes</h2>\n'
                '  <p>If you are running a 1 GB VPS and refuse to pay any software licensing fees, '
                '<strong>HestiaCP</strong> is the clear standout. Its architecture is modern, clean, and intentionally '
                'lean:</p>\n'
                '  <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">\n'
                '    <li><strong>High Performance Architecture:</strong> Employs Nginx as a reverse proxy caching '
