                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">3. cPanel &amp; WHM: The Feature-Rich '
                'Industry Standard (Best on 2GB+ RAM)</h2>\n'
                '  <p>While installing cPanel on a 1 GB VPS is discouraged due to memory constraints, on a <strong>2 '
                'GB to 4 GB RAM VPS</strong>, cPanel remains the unmatched leader for serious web hosting:</p>\n'
