                'for instant WordPress acceleration, or add CloudLinux to protect your server from noisy '
                'neighbors.</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>Automated SSL and Mail Routing:</strong> AutoSSL, Roundcube webmail, Exim mail '
                'routing, and automated backups work out of the box with zero manual terminal configuration.</li>\n'
                '  </ul>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">Web Server Flexibility: OpenLiteSpeed, '
                'Nginx, and Apache</h2>\n'
                '  <p>How each control panel delivers web traffic dramatically impacts memory consumption and PHP '
                'concurrency on constrained VPS hardware:</p>\n'
                '  <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">\n'
                '    <li><strong>DirectAdmin CustomBuild:</strong> Offers exceptional flexibility out of the box. '
                'Administrators can choose between standalone Apache, Apache with Nginx reverse proxy, standalone '
                'Nginx, or OpenLiteSpeed without requiring commercial web server licenses.</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>HestiaCP Pre-Configured Reverse Proxy:</strong> Automatically pairs Nginx on frontend '
