                '          <td class="p-3 text-gray-600">Free (Vendor)</td>\n'
                '        </tr>\n'
                '        <tr>\n'
                '          <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-gray-900">Site Owner</td>\n'
                '          <td class="p-3">1 Worker</td>\n'
                '          <td class="p-3 text-emerald-600 font-semibold">Unlimited RAM</td>\n'
                '          <td class="p-3">Up to 5 Domains</td>\n'
                '          <td class="p-3 text-emerald-600 font-semibold">$4.00/mo</td>\n'
                '        </tr>\n'
                '        <tr>\n'
                '          <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-gray-900">Web Host Lite</td>\n'
                '          <td class="p-3">1 Worker</td>\n'
                '          <td class="p-3 text-emerald-600 font-semibold">Unlimited RAM</td>\n'
                '          <td class="p-3">Up to 14 Domains</td>\n'
                '          <td class="p-3 text-emerald-600 font-semibold">$4.00/mo</td>\n'
                '        </tr>\n'
                '        <tr>\n'
                '          <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-gray-900">Web Host Essential</td>\n'
                '          <td class="p-3">1 Worker</td>\n'
                '          <td class="p-3 text-emerald-600 font-semibold">Unlimited RAM</td>\n'
                '          <td class="p-3">Unlimited Domains</td>\n'
                '          <td class="p-3 text-emerald-600 font-semibold">$4.00/mo</td>\n'
                '        </tr>\n'
                '        <tr>\n'
                '          <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-gray-900">Web Host Professional</td>\n'
                '          <td class="p-3">2 Workers</td>\n'
                '          <td class="p-3 text-emerald-600 font-semibold">Unlimited RAM</td>\n'
                '          <td class="p-3">Unlimited Domains</td>\n'
                '          <td class="p-3 text-emerald-600 font-semibold">$4.00/mo</td>\n'
                '        </tr>\n'
                '      </tbody>\n'
                '    </table>\n'
                '  </div>\n'
                '  <figure class="my-6 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 bg-gray-900/5 p-2">\n'
                '  <img src="/assets/img/blog/litespeed-license-pricing-costs-vps-requirements-1.svg" alt="LiteSpeed '
                'Web Server license tiers and VPS hardware requirements diagram" width="800" height="420" '
                'class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg shadow-sm" loading="lazy">\n'
                '  <figcaption class="text-xs text-gray-500 text-center mt-2 px-2">Overview of LiteSpeed Enterprise '
                'licensing tiers, worker processes, and memory capabilities.</figcaption>\n'
                '</figure>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">2. What are Worker Processes and How Many Do '
                'You Need?</h2>\n'
                '  <p>In LiteSpeed Enterprise, a <em>worker process</em> is a dedicated process thread capable of '
                'serving thousands of simultaneous client connections. Because LiteSpeed uses asynchronous '
