                'font-semibold hover:underline">LiteSpeed</a> on our <a href="/deals" class="text-blue-600 '
                'font-semibold hover:underline">combo discount stacks</a> to build an enterprise-grade hosting '
                'platform with complete peace of mind.</p>\n'
                '</section>\n',
