                'load spikes to dangerous levels, eventually crashing Apache or MySQL.</p>\n'
                '  <p>CloudLinux replaces the standard Linux kernel with a modified kernel featuring '
                '<strong>Lightweight Virtual Environment (LVE)</strong> technology. System administrators set strict '
                'resource caps per user account:</p>\n'
