                'core or multiple cores.</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>Memory Limits (PMEM):</strong> Prevents memory leaks from triggering system-wide '
                'Out-Of-Memory (OOM) kernel panics.</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>I/O and IOPS Limits:</strong> Protects NVMe disk storage arrays from being saturated '
                'by runaway database imports.</li>\n'
