                'Ryzen, or Intel Xeon Ice Lake/Sapphire Rapids) with dedicated clock cycles rather than oversubscribed '
                'shared cores.</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>Storage Technology:</strong> Insist on <strong>NVMe SSD storage</strong>. Traditional '
                'SATA SSDs or networked magnetic SANs choke on MySQL database queries during concurrent visitor '
                'spikes.</li>\n'
