                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">Boosting Performance on Budget VPS with '
                'LiteSpeed</h2>\n'
                '  <p>If you choose a budget VPS with 4 GB of RAM, you can dramatically expand your hosting capacity '
