                '    <li><strong>MySQL Governor:</strong> Real-time monitoring and throttling of database queries that '
                'pin CPU cores.</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>PHP Selector:</strong> Multi-version PHP execution allowing end-users to select '
                'custom PHP extensions and memory limits from their control panel.</li>\n'
                '  </ul>\n'
                '  <p>CloudLinux integrates natively with our wholesale <a href="/cpanel-license" class="text-blue-600 '
                'font-semibold hover:underline">cPanel licenses</a>, providing seamless administrative controls inside '
                'the WHM graphical interface.</p>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">4. Check IP Re-issuance Flexibility and '
                'Activation Speed</h2>\n'
                '  <p>As your hosting company grows, you will inevitably migrate servers, upgrade VPS hardware, or '
                'renumber IP subnets. Beware of license vendors who lock your license to a specific datacenter or '
                "charge hidden fees each time you change your server's IP address.</p>\n"
                '  <p>With LicenBase, IP re-issuance is completely free and instantaneous through your client control '
                'portal. If you decommission an old node and deploy a new AlmaLinux server, simply update the IPv4 '
                'address and execute the sync script to resume production operations in seconds.</p>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">5. Enhance Server Security with Imunify360 '
                'Integration</h2>\n'
                '  <p>While CloudLinux provides tenant resource isolation and filesystem sandboxing, it is most potent '
                'when paired with real-time web application defense. Adding an <a href="/imunify360-license" '
                'class="text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline">Imunify360 license</a> gives you automated '
                'malware cleanup, an AI-driven Web Application Firewall (WAF), and herd-immunity defense against '
                'brute-force attacks.</p>\n'
                '  <p>To maximize savings across your infrastructure stack, explore our <a href="/deals" '
