                'allocated by the data center: vCPU cores, ECC RAM, NVMe solid-state storage, bandwidth, and a '
                'dedicated public IPv4 address.</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>Control Panel Software (cPanel &amp; WHM):</strong> The proprietary software suite '
                'developed by WebPros that automates Apache/Nginx web servers, MariaDB, Exim mail handling, DNS zones, '
                "and Let's Encrypt AutoSSL.</li>\n"
                '  </ul>\n'
                '  <p>Traditional "Managed Hosting" vendors combine these two elements into a single bundled plan, '
                'tack on significant profit margins, and charge triple-digit monthly rates. By unbundling them, you '
                'can build a high-performance hosting setup for a fraction of the cost.</p>\n'
