                'each year while providing superior hardware performance and complete operational freedom.</p>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">Hardware Evaluation: What to Look for in a '
                'Budget VPS</h2>\n'
                '  <p>When selecting an unmanaged VPS provider (such as Hetzner, OVHcloud, Linode, or Vultr), '
                'prioritize these hardware specifications:</p>\n'
                '  <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">\n'
