                'latest</code></pre>\n'
                '    </li>\n'
                '    <li>Order an automated <a href="/cpanel-license" class="text-blue-600 font-semibold '
                'hover:underline">cPanel license</a> from LicenBase starting at $4.00/month by entering your server '
                'IPv4.</li>\n'
                '    <li>Run <code>/usr/local/cpanel/cpkeyclt</code> in your terminal. Your license verifies '
                'instantly.</li>\n'
                '  </ol>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">Maximize Speed with LiteSpeed and '
                'Multi-License Bundles</h2>\n'
                '  <p>To get the highest possible return on investment from a low-cost VPS, upgrade your web serving '
