                'archive from wordpress.org, upload it via SFTP or cPanel File Manager, extract the files, create a '
                'MySQL database and user in phpMyAdmin, grant database privileges, edit <code>wp-config.php</code>, '
                'and run the five-minute web browser installer. For a single site, this takes 10 to 15 minutes; for '
                'ten sites, it drains hours of productive developer time.</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>Softaculous Automated Installation:</strong> You fill out a simple form specifying '
                'site name, admin username, and desired plugins. Softaculous automatically creates the database, '
