                'accounts:\n'
                '      <pre class="bg-gray-900 text-gray-100 p-3 rounded-lg text-xs overflow-x-auto '
                'my-2"><code>cagefsctl --init &amp;&amp; cagefsctl --enable-all</code></pre>\n'
                '    </li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>MySQL Governor Service:</strong> Verify that database query throttling is active:\n'
                '      <pre class="bg-gray-900 text-gray-100 p-3 rounded-lg text-xs overflow-x-auto '
                'my-2"><code>systemctl enable --now db_governor &amp;&amp; systemctl status db_governor</code></pre>\n'
                '    </li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>PHP Selector Setup:</strong> Install multi-version Alt-PHP packages to allow '
                'customers to choose their PHP runtime directly from cPanel.</li>\n'
                '  </ul>\n'
                '  <p>CloudLinux works seamlessly alongside <a href="/cpanel-license" class="text-blue-600 '
                'font-semibold hover:underline">cPanel &amp; WHM</a> and <a href="/litespeed-license" '
                'class="text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline">LiteSpeed Web Server</a> to provide unshakeable '
                'stability. If you ever change hosting providers, you can update your licensed IP address instantly '
