                '  <figure class="my-6 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 bg-gray-900/5 p-2">\n'
                '    <img src="/assets/img/blog/whmcs-automation-guide-billing-licenses-1.svg" alt="WHMCS automated '
                'billing and server provisioning architecture diagram" width="800" height="420" class="w-full h-auto '
                'rounded-lg shadow-sm" loading="lazy">\n'
                '    <figcaption class="text-xs text-gray-500 text-center mt-2 px-2">End-to-end WHMCS automation '
                'pipeline from client order to autonomous lifecycle renewal.</figcaption>\n'
                '  </figure>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">Connecting WHMCS to cPanel &amp; WHM via '
                'Secure API Tokens</h2>\n'
                '  <p>To enable instant account provisioning without storing root passwords in your database, connect '
