                'class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-gray-200"&gt;\n'
                '  &lt;table class="w-full text-left text-sm text-gray-600"&gt;\n'
                '    &lt;!-- Markdown or HTML Table Content --&gt;\n'
                '  &lt;/table&gt;\n'
                '&lt;/div&gt;</code></pre>\n'
                '  <p>This allows mobile visitors to scroll smoothly through comparative data without distorting the '
                'surrounding article typography.</p>\n'
