                'layer:</p>\n'
                '  <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">\n'
                '    <li><strong>Lightweight Virtualized Environment (LVE):</strong> Enforces strict per-tenant '
                'resource limits. You can specify exact caps for CPU cores (SPEED), physical memory (PMEM), read/write '
                'throughput (I/O), IOPS, and concurrent connections (EP). When an account hits its limit, only that '
                'specific site returns a 508 error while the rest of the server remains unaffected.</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>CageFS Virtual File System:</strong> Encloses each user inside their own private '
                'sandbox. Tenants cannot see server system files, view active processes of other users, or browse '
                'sibling document roots. This stops symlink attacks and configuration file harvesting '
                'completely.</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>Hardened PHP &amp; PHP Selector:</strong> Lets clients select their preferred PHP '
                'version (from legacy 7.4 to cutting-edge 8.2, 8.3, and 8.4) directly from cPanel, while CloudLinux '
                'continuously backports security patches to older unsupported PHP versions.</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>MySQL Governor:</strong> Automatically throttles queries from abusive database users '
                'in real time, preventing MySQL server crashes.</li>\n'
                '  </ul>\n'
                '  <figure class="my-6 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 bg-gray-900/5 p-2">\n'
