                'Environments Need It?</h2>\n'
                '  <p>Imunify360 is an all-in-one automated server security platform developed by CloudLinux Inc. '
                'Specifically designed for multi-tenant shared hosting and cloud servers, it operates as an integrated '
                'daemon that continuously monitors web traffic, system authentication, file system modifications, and '
                'kernel integrity.</p>\n'
                '  <p>The hosting environments that benefit most from Imunify360 include:</p>\n'
                '  <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">\n'
                '    <li><strong>Commercial Shared Hosting Providers:</strong> Hosting hundreds of disparate '
                'WordPress, Joomla, and custom PHP websites on a single server creates high risk. One outdated plugin '
                "can compromise an entire virtual host and blackhole the server\\'s shared outbound IP. Imunify360 "
                'isolates threats automatically before they contaminate neighboring accounts.</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>Digital Agencies &amp; Web Developers:</strong> Agencies managing client websites '
                'often struggle with clients installing insecure plugins or failing to apply core CMS security '
                'patches. Imunify360 provides "virtual patching" via its WAF, protecting client sites even when '
                'software updates are delayed.</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>Reseller Hosting Accounts:</strong> Resellers on high-density cPanel or DirectAdmin '
                'servers need self-service security so their customers can review scan reports and restore quarantined '
                'files without submitting tier-1 support tickets.</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>High-Traffic E-Commerce VPS:</strong> WooCommerce and Magento stores require active '
                'defense against credential stuffing, automated credit card skimming injections, and malicious '
                'checkout redirections.</li>\n'
                '  </ul>\n'
                '  <figure class="my-6 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 bg-gray-900/5 p-2">\n'
                '    <img src="/assets/img/blog/imunify360-pricing-features-license-costs-guide-1.svg" alt="Imunify360 '
                'security architecture, malware cleanup and license pricing guide" width="800" height="420" '
                'class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg shadow-sm" loading="lazy">\n'
                '    <figcaption class="text-xs text-gray-500 text-center mt-2 px-2">Imunify360 six-layer defense '
                'architecture protecting multi-tenant hosting environments against automated web '
                'exploits.</figcaption>\n'
