                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">2. The 6-Layer Security Architecture: How '
                'Imunify360 Outperforms Free Tools</h2>\n'
                '  <p>Many system administrators initially attempt to protect servers using combinations of free '
                'utilities: ConfigServer Security &amp; Firewall (CSF), Fail2ban, and ClamAV. While useful, these '
