                "    <li><strong>Symptom 4:</strong> The server\\'s outbound mail IP gets blacklisted on Spamhaus, "
                'causing legitimate emails across all 140 domains to bounce.</li>\n'
                '  </ul>\n'
                '  <p><strong>The Imunify360 Resolution:</strong></p>\n'
                '  <ol class="list-decimal space-y-2 pl-6">\n'
                '    <li><strong>Memory Interception:</strong> When the attacker attempts to execute the obfuscated '
                'web shell, <em>Proactive Defense</em> analyzes the sequence of system calls in memory. It detects '
                'malicious behavior (unauthorized file creation, outward TCP socket connection) and freezes the '
                'execution before the script can write to disk.</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>Surgical De-Infection:</strong> The automated file scanner identifies the compromised '
                'WordPress files (such as <code>wp-config.php</code> or active theme templates). Instead of deleting '
                'the files, Imunify360 trims the exact injected payload and restores clean operational code.</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>IP Isolation &amp; CAPTCHA:</strong> The attacking bot IP is immediately placed on '
