                'increases, support ticket drops, and resource isolation ROI.</figcaption>\n'
                '  </figure>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">2. The Financial Return on Investment (ROI) '
                'of CloudLinux</h2>\n'
                '  <p>While official CloudLinux licenses cost $16 to $24/month per server, the financial returns far '
                'outweigh the licensing fee:</p>\n'
                '  <ol class="list-decimal space-y-2 pl-6">\n'
                '    <li><strong>35% to 50% Higher Account Density:</strong> Because runaway processes cannot crash '
                'the node, a 16 GB server that previously hosted 40 accounts can safely accommodate 70 to 80 '
                'accounts.</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>40% Reduction in Support Overhead:</strong> Automatic resource containment and '
                'self-service PHP Selector eliminate the vast majority of performance-related customer helpdesk '
                'tickets.</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>Reduced Customer Churn:</strong> Shared hosting clients stay when their websites '
                'experience consistent 99.9% uptime shielded from bad neighbors.</li>\n'
                '  </ol>\n'
                '  <p>Evaluate your complete multi-server break-even economics using our <a '
                'href="/blog/hosting-break-even-calculator-pricing-strategy" class="text-blue-600 font-semibold '
                'hover:underline">Hosting Break-Even &amp; Pricing Strategy Guide</a>.</p>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">3. CageFS and MySQL Governor: Security and '
                'Database Stability</h2>\n'
                '  <p>Beyond LVE quotas, CloudLinux includes two indispensable enterprise features: '
                '<strong>CageFS</strong> encapsulates each user in a private virtual filesystem, completely blocking '
                'symlink attacks and configuration file snooping. Meanwhile, <strong>MySQL Governor</strong> monitors '
                'real-time database query execution, automatically throttling abusive MySQL queries before the '
                'database engine can lock up.</p>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
