                'hover:underline">combo packages</a>, read our company background <a href="/about" '
                'class="text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline">about us</a>, check our <a href="/license-policy" '
                'class="text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline">license policy</a>, or connect with our support '
                'specialists on our <a href="/contact" class="text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline">contact '
                'page</a>.</p>\n'
                '</section>',
