                'href="/blog/cloudlinux-license-calculator-density-roi" class="text-blue-600 font-semibold '
                'hover:underline">CloudLinux Density Guide</a>.</li>\n'
                '  </ul>\n'
                '  <p>Browse our discounted <a href="/deals" class="text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline">combo '
                'packages</a>, read our company background <a href="/about" class="text-blue-600 font-semibold '
                'hover:underline">about us</a>, check our <a href="/license-policy" class="text-blue-600 font-semibold '
                'hover:underline">license policy</a>, or connect with our support specialists on our <a '
                'href="/contact" class="text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline">contact page</a>.</p>\n'
                '</section>',
