                'Terabytes</h2>\n'
                '  <p>Understanding network metrics requires converting between continuous transmission rates and '
                'aggregated storage volumes:</p>\n'
                '  <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">\n'
                '    <li><strong>Port Speed (Mbit/s):</strong> Measures raw pipeline capacity—the maximum speed data '
                'can flow into or out of your network interface at any given instant.</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>Data Transfer (GB / TB):</strong> Measures the cumulative volume of data transmitted '
                'over time (typically billed across a 30-day calendar cycle).</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>Standard Conversion Formula:</strong> <code>Monthly Gigabytes = (Port Speed in Mbit/s '
                '/ 8) x 3600 seconds x 24 hours x 30 days / 1000</code>.</li>\n'
                '  </ul>\n'
                '  <p>Convert any port speed or traffic requirement instantly using our free online <a '
                'href="/tools/bandwidth-calculator" class="text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline">Bandwidth '
                'Calculator</a> and project provider transit bills with the <a href="/tools/bandwidth-cost-calculator" '
                'class="text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline">Bandwidth Cost Calculator</a>.</p>\n'
                '  <figure class="my-6 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 bg-gray-900/5 p-2">\n'
                '    <img src="/assets/img/blog/vps-bandwidth-calculator-data-transfer-costs-1.svg" alt="VPS bandwidth '
                'calculation model, port speed conversion and monthly data transfer diagram" width="800" height="420" '
