                'font-semibold hover:underline">LiteSpeed License Calculator Guide</a>.</p>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">4. Deploying High-Throughput Hosting with '
                'LicenBase</h2>\n'
                '  <p>Maximize your network efficiency and control panel management with wholesale licensing from '
                'LicenBase:</p>\n'
                '  <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">\n'
                '    <li>Deploy ultra-efficient zero-copy HTTP serving with an authentic <a href="/litespeed-license" '
                'class="text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline">LiteSpeed license</a> for $5.00/mo.</li>\n'
