                'primary public IPv4 address of the host machine. Shared, dynamic, or non-routed private IPs (such as '
                'standard NAT without 1:1 public binding) will fail automated verification.</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>Supported Operating System:</strong> Ensure your VPS is running AlmaLinux 8 or 9, '
                'Rocky Linux 8 or 9, CloudLinux 8 or 9, or Ubuntu 20.04/22.04 LTS.</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>Outbound Network Connectivity:</strong> Your VPS firewall must permit outbound TCP '
                'traffic on ports 80 (HTTP) and 443 (HTTPS) to resolve official licensing clusters.</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>Accurate System Clocks:</strong> Run <code>timedatectl</code> to verify that your '
                'system clock is synchronized via NTP. A clock drift greater than a few minutes can invalidate '
                'cryptographic TLS handshakes with licensing nodes.</li>\n'
                '  </ul>\n'
