                'breakdown: software license vs engineering labor hours.</figcaption>\n'
                '  </figure>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">2. The True Cost of Ownership: Software vs '
                'Engineering Labor</h2>\n'
                '  <p>When calculating hosting expenses, examine the hidden cost of system administration time:</p>\n'
