                '  <p>Validate the local zone file syntax using native BIND diagnostic utilities:</p>\n'
                '  <div class="bg-gray-900 rounded-lg p-4 font-mono text-xs text-gray-100 overflow-x-auto">\n'
                '    <p class="text-gray-400"># Verify syntax for a problematic domain</p>\n'
                '    <p>named-checkzone example.com /var/named/example.com.db</p>\n'
                '  </div>\n'
                '  <p>If the check outputs errors such as <code>has no address records (A or AAAA)</code> or <code>bad '
                'zone transfer format</code>, edit the zone file manually in <code>/var/named/example.com.db</code> or '
                'fix it inside WHM <em>Edit DNS Zone</em>. Once corrected, rebuild the DNS configuration and increment '
                'the serial number:</p>\n'
                '  <div class="bg-gray-900 rounded-lg p-4 font-mono text-xs text-gray-100 overflow-x-auto">\n'
                '    <p class="text-gray-400"># Rebuild DNS configuration and re-index zone templates</p>\n'
                '    <p>/scripts/rebuilddnsconfig</p>\n'
                '    <p class="text-gray-400 mt-2"># Restart named / PowerDNS service</p>\n'
                '    <p>/scripts/restartsrv_named</p>\n'
                '  </div>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">Best Practices for High-Availability DNS '
                'Clustering</h2>\n'
                '  <p>To avoid cluster degradation in enterprise environments, adhere to these architectural '
                'recommendations:</p>\n'
                '  <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">\n'
                '    <li><strong>Deploy Geographically Isolated DNSOnly Nodes:</strong> Run at least two cPanel '
                'DNSOnly instances hosted on separate networks, data centers, and upstream transit providers. cPanel '
                'DNSOnly requires minimal resources (1 vCPU, 1 GB RAM) and does not require a paid cPanel '
