                '  </ul>\n'
                '\n'
                '  <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mt-4">2. Fixing Physical Memory (pMEM) Exhaustion</h3>\n'
                '  <p>Heavy page builders (such as Elementor or Divi) and automated backup plugins often exceed '
