                'between Layer 3/4 packet filtering (CSF) and Layer 7 deep inspection (Imunify360).</figcaption>\n'
                '</figure>\n'
                '  <p><strong>ConfigServer Security &amp; Firewall (CSF)</strong> operates primarily at <strong>Layers '
                '3 and 4</strong> (Network and Transport). It is a management wrapper around Linux '
                '<code>iptables</code> and <code>nftables</code>, bundled with a Login Failure Daemon '
                '(<code>lfd</code>). It excels at:</p>\n'
