                '    <li><strong>Parallel TLS Handshakes:</strong> Cryptographic SSL handshakes consume considerable '
                'CPU cycles. Multi-worker licenses (2, 4, or 8 workers) parallelize TLS handshakes across distinct '
                'system threads without queue blocking.</li>\n'
                "    <li><strong>Mitigating Hanging FastCGI Scripts:</strong> If a customer's slow database query "
                'briefly stalls worker processing, secondary workers continue answering inbound HTTP traffic '
                'seamlessly.</li>\n'
                '  </ul>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">LSCache Architecture: ESI &amp; Dynamic '
                'WordPress Optimization</h2>\n'
                '  <p>The decisive technological advantage of LiteSpeed Web Server over NGINX and Apache is its native '
                'server-level caching engine: <strong>LiteSpeed Cache (LSCache)</strong>. While traditional PHP '
                'caching solutions require invoking the PHP interpreter on every request, LiteSpeed serves fully '
                'cached HTML pages directly from memory at the web server layer.</p>\n'
                '  <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">\n'
                '    <li><strong>Edge Side Includes (ESI):</strong> On high-traffic WooCommerce stores, cart fragments '
                'and private user greetings normally prevent page caching. LSCache utilizes ESI to punch dynamic holes '
                'in cached pages, allowing 98% of the page to be served from static cache while injecting private '
                'account blocks in real time.</li>\n'
                '    <li><strong>Built-In Crawler Engine:</strong> LiteSpeed includes an automated crawler that sweeps '
                'XML sitemaps during low-traffic overnight hours, ensuring product pages and blog posts remain warm in '
                'RAM before human visitors arrive.</li>\n'
                '  </ul>\n'
                '</section>\n'
                '\n'
                '<section class="space-y-4">\n'
                '  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-3">LiteSpeed Buying Guide: Wholesale Licensing '
